  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 722.03 BAT for Inorganics",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 722.03 BAT for Inorganics. The best available technology, treatment technique, or other means available for achieving compliance with the MCLs for inorganics specified in Env-Dw 704.02 shall be as specified in 40 CFR 141.62(c) and (d).\n\nSource. #10617, eff 6-1-14; ss by #12820, eff 6-28-19",
